{"4558350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roll with Splonk", "steam_appid": 4558350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=958 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Splonk lives in the corner of your screen, on top of everything else, happily rolling dice and printing money while you watch stuff, browse, or pretend to work. Check in whenever you feel like it, dump your winnings into new dice, relics and upgrades, then go back to what you were doing while the numbers keep climbing. Roll, get rich, buy better stuff, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every die is randomly generated, so there's always a chance of stumbling onto a real gem. Stack dice that complement each other, craft a few improvements onto them, add relics and upgrades on top, and watch the numbers get completely out of hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch Splonk do dumb stuff while you become a bajillionaire, and while leaving you enough time to also become a bajillionaire in real life! Splonk handles the grinding while you get on with your day!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=958 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/ece9823d2b2dd4710903209ffd7b9b49.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Splonk lives in the corner of your screen, on top of everything else, happily rolling dice and printing money while you watch stuff, browse, or pretend to work. Check in whenever you feel like it, dump your winnings into new dice, relics and upgrades, then go back to what you were doing while the numbers keep climbing. Roll, get rich, buy better stuff, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/1fbc15400e1d5bc6068c8776ad90759d.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every die is randomly generated, so there's always a chance of stumbling onto a real gem. Stack dice that complement each other, craft a few improvements onto them, add relics and upgrades on top, and watch the numbers get completely out of hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.poster.avif?t=1787413365\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.webm?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558350/extras/d1602a896650c34a08ee10ca8c116a52.mp4?t=1787413365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch Splonk do dumb stuff while you become a bajillionaire, and while leaving you enough time to also become a bajillionaire in real life! Splonk handles the grinding while you get on with your day!<